{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shard_introspection", "label": "Shard introspection", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Starting a region used to hand back one ref and nothing to ask; four ClusterSharding APIs plus one cluster event close that."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards_api", "label": "ClusterSharding.shards()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The coordinator owns the shard map but not the entity counts, so the call fans out to every registered region and joins against the allocation map \u2014 one extra round trip, with a partial-answer deadline so a slow or departed region contributes entityCount 0 instead of failing the whole call."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "label": "ShardInfo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carries a live ref rather than just placement data, so one query answers both \"what is out there\" and \"how do I talk to it\"; the trade-off is that ShardInfo is not JSON-serialisable."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_resident_flag", "label": "resident flag", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Separates a shard that is running and happens to be empty from one that passivated while empty \u2014 entityCount 0 reports both. It does not affect reachability: ref works either way."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardreffor", "label": "shardRefFor()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Placing a shard with no home is exactly what a first message would have done; locally the ask wakes the shard because a handle to a non-running actor would be a handle to nothing, remotely the first tell does."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_entityreffor", "label": "entityRefFor()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The handle names its entity outright so extractEntityId is never consulted, and it is synchronous to obtain because the shard is hash(entityId) % numShards. Location-transparent because it routes through the local region; a proxy region is enough to hand one out."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmapchanged", "label": "ShardMapChanged event", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The coordinator broadcasts to each region and the region publishes locally, so the event fires on every node rather than only the leader. Broadcasts are coalesced, so version counts broadcasts, not individual assignments."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmap_api", "label": "ClusterSharding.shardMap()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because the event reaches every node, the last map can simply be remembered \u2014 synchronous and free, no round trip, no DistributedData, no coordinatorStateStore. Null until the coordinator has published once for the type."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_remote_ask_timeout", "label": "ask on a remote shard ref times out", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ask synthesises a one-shot reply ref that has no place in another node's actor tree for the reply to resolve against; send GetShardStats with your own actor's self as replyTo, or use shards(), whose reply the region routes home."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_snapshot_not_subscription", "label": "A snapshot, not a subscription", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "entityCount was true when the hosting region answered and node holds only until the next rebalance \u2014 hold the ref, which survives a stale count, not the node address."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_unplaced_shards_absent", "label": "Shards with no home are absent", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nothing has asked for them, so the coordinator has had no reason to place them: a 64-shard type that has seen three entity ids reports one to three shards."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shard_introspection", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shard_introspection", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardreffor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shard_introspection", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_entityreffor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shard_introspection", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmapchanged", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards_api", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_resident_flag", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_snapshot_not_subscription", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards_api", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_unplaced_shards_absent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardreffor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_remote_ask_timeout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmapchanged", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmap_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmap_api", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shard_introspection", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_passivation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shard_introspection", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}